"Olive is an Adjuster in Alden Thorn's CNH class."
"She casts illusions of herself, crafted from memories of tasks, plus an antitargeting spell."
"She also has the same superslick ice trap spell as Everly."
"After the flood she thought of moving off campus to be with her mother and brother."
"She plans eight years: three of high school, four of university, one to build her brand."
"She is A-rank, fights with a pink baseball bat, and Alden beat her in seconds in a duel."
